      ":question/problem": "![](images/c0/c0f6ed35fa0c69a0c75aee0c3cd556d687d9cb71fd9905f28b553068600db830.png)\n\nThe dot plot above shows the number of riders in each team that completed the Tour de France final stage in a particular year. Each dot represents a different team. Which of the following statements are true?\n\n1. The distribution is symmetric.\n2. The mean of the distribution equals $5$.\n3. The mean of the distribution exceeds $5$.\n4. The mean of the distribution is less than $5$."
